# Shared by both images built from this context:
#   Dockerfile                 the Node API server (docker-compose.yml)
#   .devcontainer/Dockerfile   the Python sandbox / Dev Container
#
# This file used to open by describing the root Dockerfile as "the Python
# simulation/literature stack only", which stopped being true when that
# Dockerfile was replaced in place by the Node build. A comment describing
# the wrong file is how the devcontainer went unnoticed for a month.
#
# Science-Agent-Pipeline is a separate project with its own tooling and
# belongs in neither image.
Science-Agent-Pipeline/
node_modules/

# 93 MB of marketing site, plus build output that either image would only
# rebuild. Nothing here is importable by the engine or the API server.
caterva-site/
dist/
coverage/

